{"id":"viste","lemma":"viste","pos":"intj","rank":536,"glosses":["you know; used as a space filler, usually in the middle of a sentence, or when telling a story"],"ipa":"/ˈbiste/","examples":[{"text":"¿Viste a mi mujer?","en":"Have you seen my wife?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519662","words":[null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"woman"}]},{"text":"¿Viste lo que yo vi?","en":"Did you see what I did?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458642","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see, to spot","l":"ver"}],"phrases":[[1,3,"what, that which"]]},{"text":"Me perdí la película. ¿Tú la viste?","en":"I missed the movie. Did you see it?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/77578","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"film"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Ella nunca se viste de verde.","en":"She never wears green.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636635","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"oneself"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"green"}]},{"text":"Creo que viste algo.","en":"I think you saw something.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/137571","words":[{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"something, anything"}]}]}